cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscripts below."
title: "Stage-conditional shift normalization for subject-robust EEG sleep staging"
abstract: >-
  Code, fitted checkpoints, and released result summaries for
  stage-conditional shift normalization (SCSN), a closed-form label-free
  test-time correction for subject shift in single-channel EEG sleep staging.
  The repository contains the training, probe, adaptation, conformal-reliability,
  and statistical-analysis code and regenerates every table and figure.
type: software
